# 4P3X Reusable Base Structure™ — Environment Variables Example
# Created by Kyzel Kreates | Powered by 4P3X Intelligent AI
# Run 8.5 — Placeholder values only. NEVER paste real secrets here.
#
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Copy this file to .env for local development:   cp .env.example .env
# 2. Replace each YOUR_..._HERE placeholder with the real value in .env ONLY.
# 3. NEVER commit .env to version control.
# 4. NEVER paste real keys into .env.example — placeholders only.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── AI Provider (optional — AI features are local-advisory only in this base) ─
VITE_AI_PROVIDER=YOUR_AI_PROVIDER_HERE
VITE_AI_MODEL=YOUR_AI_MODEL_HERE

# ── OpenAI (if used in a future variant — DO NOT add to this base) ───────────
# VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=YOUR_OPENAI_API_KEY_HERE

# ── Anthropic (if used in a future variant) ───────────────────────────────────
# VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=YOUR_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY_HERE

# ── Google / Gemini (if used in a future variant) ────────────────────────────
# VITE_GOOGLE_API_KEY=YOUR_GOOGLE_API_KEY_HERE

# ── Supabase (optional — not required by this base; for future variant sync) ──
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=YOUR_SUPABASE_URL_HERE
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY_HERE
# NOTE: SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY is a BACKEND-ONLY secret.
#       It must NEVER be placed in a VITE_ variable or any frontend file.

# ── App Identity (safe to include — no secrets) ───────────────────────────────
VITE_APP_NAME=4P3X Reusable Base Structure
VITE_APP_VERSION=1.0.0
VITE_APP_ENV=development

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SECURITY RULES:
# - DO NOT add STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, PRIVATE_KEY,
#   WEBHOOK_SECRET, ADMIN_TOKEN, or any server-side secret here.
# - Only VITE_ prefixed variables are exposed to the frontend bundle.
# - All backend secrets belong in a server environment, NOT in this file.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
